)`; if testing extraction directly, set `org.sqlite.tmpdir` to a temporary directory and restore any changed system properties.\\\",\\n  \\\"risks\\\": [\\n    \\\"Native-image verification may still expose platform linker/runtime issues in the bundled JNI library; local Gradle and Native Image runs remain authoritative.\\\",\\n    \\\"Avoid tests that only instantiate classes without opening a JDBC connection, because they may not reach native library extraction/loading paths.\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\",\"textSignature\":\"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_02434b2590dbf217016a28134cbee08190ba6dbad40e9bd0b6\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}],\"api\":\"openai-responses\",\"provider\":\"OCA\",\"model\":\"oca/gpt-5.5\",\"usage\":{\"input\":801,\"output\":753,\"cacheRead\":24064,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":25618,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1781011260338,\"responseId\":\"resp_02434b2590dbf217016a28133d77408190b72f3fc4dfc87836\"}}\n/home/mihailo/.pi/agent/sessions/--home-mihailo-git-graalvm-reachability-metadata-forge-local_repositories-forge_benchmark_worktrees-nexus_neural_da_pi_gpt-5.5-93965428fe50--/2026-05-04T20-47-14-408Z_019df4be-bde7-76bd-8207-d59ee23dc25e.jsonl:51:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"04df4bc8\",\"parentId\":\"ba3d92ee\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-04T20:49:13.017Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"**Resolving serialization issues**\\n\\nI'm facing a problem where a string won't serialize, and it looks like I need to use a custom object class that isn't recognized. I'll implement the `toString` method for the Payload, but the deserialization still results in a string. I need to make sure to insert `setObject` for the Payload and that `getObject` correctly handles the deserialization. It seems like I need to make some edits to fix this!\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_063d6f77b73648000169f906460a6081